 "text": "2016. Milan: three hospital demos in a single day. San Raffaele, Multimedica, and the European Institute of Oncology. Three of them in one car, back-to-back appointments, impossible parking. The dress code was jacket and tie\u2026 and one of them turned up in a leather jacket. Donatello told the product and the vision; the others chipped in with remarks that were embarrassing, but original. On the way home they were sure they had won them. A few months later, two of them were customers, and the third followed.",
